' Style of the use case diagrams: coloured actors, one pastel box for each context, a green or grey fill for
' the status of a use case, an ortho line style, and the notation on the lines (extend, uses, generalisation).
' Copy the files in this folder next to your use case diagrams (usecases/diagrams/). Edit freely.
' Light mode only: a white background, as for every diagram here.
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml

top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 8
skinparam ranksep 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

' Status of a use case (the fill follows what is built, from the requirements: today = built or not built).
!define COLOR_BUILT #A5D6A7
!define COLOR_TODO #D9D9D9
